{
  "museum_bench": {
    "speaker": "Bench",
    "start": [
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "hours",
            "from": 16,
            "to": 10
          }
        ],
        "node": "shut"
      },
      {
        "node": "open"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "shut": {
        "lines": [
          "A bench facing the Museum doors. A brass plate on the back: THE FRIENDS OF THE CASTLE MUSEUM, FOR THOSE WHO COME EARLY.",
          "The doors open at ten. Somebody's worn the paint through to the wood at the end nearest them. Only that end."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Wait for ten",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "rest",
                "until": 10
              }
            ],
            "goto": "waited"
          },
          {
            "label": "Not now"
          }
        ]
      },
      "waited": {
        "lines": [
          "I sit at the worn end. Nobody else comes. At ten the bolts go back behind the doors, three of them, and nobody comes out to say good morning."
        ]
      },
      "open": {
        "lines": [
          "The bench in front of the Museum. The doors are open now. There's dew all along the seat, and nobody's sat in it."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "reed_fludd": {
    "speaker": "Mrs Fludd",
    "start": [
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_fludd",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "first"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "speakerKnows",
            "news": "tuesday_asked"
          },
          {
            "if": "flag",
            "flag": "fludd_told_nurse",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "news_nurse"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questDone",
            "quest": "one_hook_empty"
          }
        ],
        "node": "after_hook"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questDone",
            "quest": "what_the_eels_eat"
          }
        ],
        "node": "after_eels"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_fludd",
            "eq": 1
          }
        ],
        "node": "second"
      },
      {
        "node": "third"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "first": {
        "lines": [
          "You came over the bridge ten minutes since. I saw you stop in the middle and look down. Everybody does. Sit by the fire if you like, it's for anyone.",
          "The men are down the beds till five. They'll not say much to you when they come up, so I'll say it for them: good evening. That's about all you'd get."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_fludd",
            "value": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "second": {
        "lines": [
          "Orders go on the slate by the hooks. Castle still wants reed for thatch, or somebody in Castle still writes it down and sends it. I couldn't say which.",
          "Four coats on those hooks, and five names burnt over them. Don't ask the men about the fifth. I keep the fire, that's all."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_fludd",
            "value": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "third": {
        "lines": [
          "The eels come up the cut at dusk, and the rats come up after the eels, and the men come up after the lot of them, at five, regular.",
          "Don't stand on the far bank after the bell. None of them does. I've never asked them why, and they've never offered, and that suits us both."
        ]
      },
      "after_eels": {
        "lines": [
          "They went back in the beds this morning, first time since the spring. Parfitt went first.",
          "He didn't say anything to me, but he lifted his hand going past. That's a speech, for Parfitt."
        ]
      },
      "after_hook": {
        "lines": [
          "Five coats. I've not seen five on those hooks since the spring. I counted them twice, and then I had Rowe count them.",
          "He said five. That's all he said. I've told them nothing about who fetched it, and you'll not tell them either."
        ]
      },
      "news_nurse": {
        "lines": [
          "Mrs Loveday says you've been asking after the nurse. Tuesdays, she came. Over the bridge after her dinner, and back across it before the lamps.",
          "One Tuesday she went past this fire on her way up to the Works, and she never came back past it. I'd have seen. I see everybody."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "fludd_told_nurse",
            "value": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
