        "lines": [
          "Five hooks on a plank by the fire, a name burnt over each: PARFITT, ROWE, DIMMOCK, LOVEDAY, SKEAT. Four coats, wet at the hems. I count them twice.",
          "Under SKEAT, in pencil: his coat is on the post at the Still Pool. nobody is to go for it. Nobody is underlined, hard enough to dent the plank."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Go for it",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "one_hook_empty"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Leave it"
          }
        ]
      },
      "wait": {
        "lines": [
          "SKEAT, and the empty hook. His coat's over the mooring post at the Still Pool, and nobody is to go for it, the pencil says."
        ]
      },
      "in": {
        "lines": [
          "The fifth hook, empty. The plank behind it is paler, the shape of a coat that hung there a long time."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Hang the coat on it",
            "actions": [
              {
