        "lines": [
          "FLOWERS AFTER THE BELL, PLEASE. A white water rose, then, and it'll have to be after nine."
        ]
      },
      "leave": {
        "lines": [
          "She's facing the beds now, with her back to the gateposts. I didn't see her turn. I set the rose down in the ring where the jar stood."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "location",
            "name": "mother_rose"
