    "nodes": {
      "land_offer": {
        "lines": [
          "I go down to the landing after the bell and ring him in. Loveday. He cuts the far beds, and he'd lose the time down there if somebody didn't ring.",
          "I won't go down on my own, not now, not without somebody beside me with a light. Would you walk down with me tonight?"
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "After the bell, then",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "loveday_landing"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not tonight"
          }
        ]
      },
      "land_wait": {
        "lines": [
          "After the bell, then. Come to me here and we'll go down together. It's only to the end of the planks."
        ]
      },
      "land_go": {
        "lines": [
          "Keep the light by me. Watch the planks, they're slippy after dark. He used to put grit down on them, and I've let it go."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "loveday_out",
            "value": 1
          },
          {
            "do": "send",
            "unit": "reed_end_loveday",
            "to": "reed_end_landing",
            "then": [
              {
                "do": "flag",
                "flag": "loveday_at_landing",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "going": {
        "lines": [
          "Stay by me. The landing's just down here. I used to walk it with my eyes shut."
        ]
      },
      "at_landing": {
        "lines": [
          "She rings the landing bell three times and waits, with her hand still on the rope. Nothing comes back off the beds.",
          "That'll do. He knows the way, if he wants it. He always said I rang too soon."
        ]
      },
      "land_in": {
        "lines": [
          "You came down with me. Nobody's done that since the spring. My sister came the once, and stood at the top of the planks.",
          "Have this. It was put by for him. He'd want it used. He never kept anything for best."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Thank you",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "loveday_landing"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "tue_ask": {
        "lines": [
          "The nurse? Tuesdays, after Mrs Allen. She came over the bridge after her dinner, and I'd have the kettle on for her.",
          "She left a bag here for Mr Pask, her next call, up at the Works. She was to pick it up on her way home. It's on the step yet. I haven't moved it."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "location",
            "name": "tuesday_reed_end_asked"
          }
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "I'll take it on to him",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "tuesday_round"
              },
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "tuesday_reed_end"
              },
              {
                "do": "give",
                "item": "nurses_bag",
                "qty": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not now",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "handin",
                "quest": "tuesday_round"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "tue_offer": {
        "lines": [
          "The nurse's bag is on the step yet, for Mr Pask at {place:hut_two}. I keep stepping over it. Will you take it on?"
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "I'll take it",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "quest",
                "quest": "tuesday_reed_end"
              },
              {
                "do": "give",
                "item": "nurses_bag",
                "qty": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Not now"
          }
        ]
      },
      "talk": {
        "lines": [
          "Reed End. We cut to order, or we did. The order slate's at the fire, if Castle still wants any.",
          "He was first down to the beds every morning. I'd shout him in at five and he'd come up grumbling, with his boots in his hand."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
